step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test the simplest robust mean over the full pool to see baseline performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a median combination over the full pool to see if a robust non-linear aggregator improves over mean and weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 on the full pool to see if a learned weighting improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming high-error models improves over weighted inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy with ARIMA to see if a single strong model beats the weighted combo.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a different best_single strategy with rf to see if a single strong model can beat ARIMA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a robust dba combination on the full pool to see if it can beat the best_single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted inverse_error combination on the smaller robust pool1 to see if a focused weighted mix improves over the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if a robust aggregator beats the weighted combo.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median aggregator on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if it outperforms the weighted combo on that pool.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool to see if inverse‑error weighting beats the best single ARIMA, exploring a different strategy kind.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a slightly larger but still robust pool improves over the best single ARIMA.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

